<title>LIECHTENSTEIN: Hilti 1996 net profit rises six percent.</title>
<headline>Hilti 1996 net profit rises six percent.</headline>
<dateline>SCHAAN, Liechtenstein</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calender 1996</p>
<p>				    (million Sfr unless stated)</p>
<p> Group net			204.2	     vs 192.5</p>
<p> Div (certificate, Sfr)     19		  vs 18</p>
<p> Consolidated sales	   2,211	     vs 2,025</p>
<p> Operating result	     140.1	     vs 171.4</p>
<p> Cash flow			332.4	     vs 310.3</p>
<p> Financial result	     84.1		vs 47.7</p>
<p> Workforce			11,600	    vs 11,220</p>
<p>NOTE - Speciality construction equipment maker Hilti AG said its operating result fell in 1996 due to extraordinary expenditures for reorganising &quot;corporate logistics in key marketing organisations&quot;. A Hilti statement did not elaborate or say how much the extraordinary costs totalled.</p>
<p>Hilti scheduled an annual news conference and meeting with financial analysts on June 13.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
